{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act41side_level_act41side_02_end","storyGroup":"act41side","storySort":5,"storyDependence":"act41side_level_act41side_02_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"EA-2","storyName":"不过别离","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"拉芙希妮与布莉吉寻找学徒提奥，却意外发现城中粮店的老板行踪蹊跷。而入夜后，深池的庆功会即将举办......酒馆之中，续杯之后，故事里贪婪的红龙再度登场。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act41side/level_act41side_02_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act41side_02","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":3,"next":5,"characters":["拉芙希妮","布莉吉","友善的居民","“拷问者”","“酷吏”","涅梅丝","“歌唱家”","“监察官”","“校官”","“官僚”","作家","神秘的女性","爱布拉娜"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$ponder_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_ponder_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":8},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper2","volume":"1","id":9},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"每一条有人住的街道都走过了，没有提奥的下落，只看到城里人身上的火......越来越旺盛，就好像忽然起风了一样......","id":10},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"而且每个人都习以为常，祛除火焰只会让他们陷入惊恐，觉得没了火的部分在离自己远去......","id":11},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"难道纳斯尔纱人真的已经......？","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......不，先别想那些，孩子要紧。该去碰碰涅梅丝说过的那位游牧民布莉吉了。","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"但......真有人会因为进不去黑林，就在城门外搭帐篷吗？","id":14},{"type":"dialog","id":15},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper1","volume":"1","id":16},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"“沿着岗哨右边走出去，蹚过小河”......","id":18},{"type":"dialog","id":19},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":20},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":21},{"type":"charslot","id":22},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_bg_bg_campsite_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":23},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":24},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":25},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":26},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":27},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"啊，好像到了。","id":29},{"type":"dialog","id":30},{"type":"charslot","id":31},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","duration":"1","id":32},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":33},{"type":"charslot","id":34},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"金色头发的佩洛，高高大大，但很灵巧。","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"这应该就是涅梅丝说的“布莉吉”——","id":37},{"type":"dialog","id":38},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_footstep_stonestep","volume":"0.6","channel":"step","loop":"false","id":39},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"step","fadetime":"2","id":40},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1","id":41},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":42},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"你认识我？","id":44},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"不，我们从前应该没见过，是涅梅丝让我来找你的。我叫苇草。","id":46},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"你......","id":48},{"type":"dialog","id":49},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-100,0","duration":"0.7","id":50},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":51},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_catsmell","volume":"1","id":52},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":53},{"type":"text","text":"拉芙希妮只看见对方往自己身前凑过来，鼻子翕动了两下，还以为这是什么游牧民的招呼方式。","id":54},{"type":"dialog","id":55},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1","id":56},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":57},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":58},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"你不是城里那条红龙。","id":60},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"你在说什么？我不是红龙，我只是——","id":62},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"你不是城里那条红龙，你是另一条红龙。另一条红龙回到城市里......好耳熟的故事。","id":64},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"你只是闻了闻，就......？","id":66},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"是啊，你身上的火的味道和城里那条红龙一点都不一样。","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"不过这都不重要。苇草，你来找我做什么？","id":69},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"提奥失踪了，听说你回城的时候常找他聊天，所以涅梅丝让我来问问你。","id":71},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"提奥失踪了？！","id":73},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"提奥今天早上出去就没回家，今天城里又乱作一团。先是涅梅丝，然后是我，我们找遍了整个纳斯尔纱，都找不到他的下落。","id":75},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"可我离开纳斯尔纱之前还去找过他，他那时候还好好的——","id":77},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"不，他那时候的情况也算不上好。","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"不管怎么说，我找了提奥之后去了趟堡垒，然后就出了城，在那之后就没见过提奥的影子。","id":80},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"该死，他现在到底在哪儿？","id":82},{"type":"dialog","id":83},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":84},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":85},{"type":"charslot","id":86},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/80/Avg_bg_bg_ltstrongpoint.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":87},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":88},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":89},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":90},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"提奥——提奥！","id":92},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"该死，我当时就该直接把他打晕，扛在肩上带走的。","id":94},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"提奥，说话！这回你必须跟我走了，提奥！","id":96},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"布莉吉，这里是......？","id":98},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"战争期间这处地块曾经被拖出去，据说是平定哪里的贵族什么的，拖回来就这样了，挂在纳斯尔纱上，一直也没人修。","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"提奥一受了什么委屈就爱往这儿跑。","id":101},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"或许提奥真的出城了？","id":103},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"......我只见过一个出城的人，就是拉格兰街的艾玛。当时没看见提奥和她一起离开。","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"而且她一个人押着好多东西在黑林外面和人碰了头，那人把东西拉走，她就一个人回来了。","id":106},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"她没注意到你？","id":108},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"城里人的眼睛耳朵鼻子都不好使。再说我们离得远着呢。","id":110},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"好多东西出去，一个人回来......她哪来的东西？","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"艾玛是做什么的？","id":113},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"她经营一家粮店，我去那里送过信。","id":115},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"粮店......出城......现在闭门不出......","id":117},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"现在也只有这么点线索了。我们赶紧过去。","id":119},{"type":"dialog","id":120},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":121},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":122},{"type":"charslot","id":123},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":124},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":125},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":126},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":127},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","duration":"0.7","id":128},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","duration":"0.7","id":129},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":130},{"type":"charslot","id":131},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1688_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"友善的居民","text":"布莉吉？苇草？","id":133},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"你好，请问你有没有看见提奥？","id":135},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1688_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"友善的居民","text":"提奥？涅梅丝把这事交给你了？","id":137},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"是的。","id":139},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1688_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"友善的居民","text":"没。天知道那小子又跑哪儿去了，别是跟着烧了农业地块的间谍一起跑了才好。","id":141},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"你！","id":143},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"布莉吉，找人要紧。","id":145},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"那艾玛呢，你看见她了吗？","id":147},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1688_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"友善的居民","text":"她早早就关店了。我也就是来转转，看看她是不是还能开门......唉，白费。","id":149},{"type":"dialog","id":150},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.6","id":151},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":152},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":153},{"type":"dialog","id":154},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":155},{"type":"charslot","id":156},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":157},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":158},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":159},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_runstop","volume":"1","id":160},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":161},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","duration":"0.5","id":162},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":163},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"唉，又来了，这股冰冷的焦煳味儿......最近整个纳斯尔纱都是这股味道......真难闻啊。","id":165},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"我一直想问，你能闻到紫火的气味？","id":167},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"是啊，那条红龙身上紫火的煳味。最近连城里人都腌入味了。","id":169},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"不只是气味......火已经蔓延到城里人身上了。","id":171},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"什么？可我没看见那些人身上有火啊？","id":173},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"原来你也看不见吗？","id":175},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"我倒要问你呢，原来你能看见？","id":177},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"......不过，唉，想想也是，毕竟你也是红龙。","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"城里的人们和那条红龙离得这么近，又把她奉若神明，惹火上身确实是早晚的事。","id":180},{"type":"dialog","id":181},{"type":"charslot","id":182},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","volume":"1","id":183},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":184},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"艾玛，是我，布莉吉。","id":186},{"type":"dialog","id":187},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":188},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","volume":"1","id":189},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":190},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"艾玛！","id":192},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"不在？","id":194},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"锁孔里有你说的紫火的味道。肯定有人在里面。怎么办，闯进去？","id":196},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......也只能这样了。","id":198},{"type":"dialog","id":199},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_originiumcastshort","volume":"1","id":200},{"type":"playsound","key":"$firemag_n","volume":"0.4","delay":"1","id":201},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0.95","g":"0.95","b":"0.95","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":202},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0.95","g":"0.95","b":"0.95","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":203},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0.95","g":"0.95","b":"0.95","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":204},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":205},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4177_brigid_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布莉吉","text":"原来红龙的火还能烧开锁头？","id":207},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1694_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉芙希妮","text":"......不管怎么说，我们先进去吧。","id":209},{"type":"dialog","id":210},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":211},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":212},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":213},{"type":"charslot","id":214},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_bg_34_g6_noblelivingroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":215},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":216},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$sjoyasorrow_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_sjoyasorrow_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":217,"musicid":1},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside","volume":"0.4","loop":"true","channel":"bse","id":218},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":219},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":220},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1749_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“拷问者”","text":"来，“酷吏”先生，喝一杯。虽说没有宴席，酒还是管够的。","id":222},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_234","focus":"m","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“酷吏”","text":"喝。","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_234.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":225},{"type":"charslot","id":226},{"type":"playsound","key":"$clink","volume":"1","id":227},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":228},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1749_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“拷问者”","text":"瞧瞧是谁来了？这不是我们的“守灵人”吗？你也收到领袖的邀请了？","id":230},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"我来......呈奉守灵人献给红龙的祭器。","id":232},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1749_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“拷问者”","text":"让我看看守灵人送来了什么好东西......哨笛，然后呢？","id":234},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"夏末节将至，守灵人的确没有多余的祭器，只能送来这枚哨笛......","id":236},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1749_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“拷问者”","text":"这就没了？","id":238},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"非常抱歉......","id":240},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_234","focus":"m","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“酷吏”","text":"不是你自己信誓旦旦地向我们保证，会带祭器来为庆典增光吗？","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_234.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"抱歉，是我考虑不周......","id":244},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_247","focus":"m","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“歌唱家”","text":"算了吧，这事也不是涅梅丝自己提的。","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_247.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“歌唱家”","text":"打一开始我就说了，一帮整天和逝者啊灵魂啊打交道的人，送来的东西也不吉利，还不如就拿来一枚哨笛呢。","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_247.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_234","focus":"m","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“监察官”","text":"你被“守灵人”救过，你当然替她说好话了！这事不能就这么算了！“守灵人”，你说，这事你怎么负责？","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_234.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"......","id":251},{"type":"dialog","id":252},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“校官”","text":"安静！","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":255},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0","channel":"bse","fadetime":"1.5","id":256},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":257},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“校官”","text":"这不是她一个人能负责的事。真要追究，守灵人对领袖不敬的这笔账可以过后算。","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“校官”","text":"祭器的事暂且放下，领袖让我先来，让大家先尽兴。","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“校官”","text":"困难期间，一切从简，本次典礼不设宴席。在领袖驾临之前，各位就先自行放松吧。","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":263},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":264},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“校官”","text":"“守灵人”，你先别走。等领袖来了，你得给她一个交待。","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":267},{"type":"charslot","id":268},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1749_1#1$1","focus":"all","id":269},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_234","focus":"all","id":270},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":271},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.6","id":272},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walk_stage","volume":"1","loop":"false","channel":"nw","id":273},{"type":"stopsound","fadetime":"2","channel":"nw","id":274},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":275},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":276},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_247","focus":"all","id":277},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_246","focus":"all","id":278},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":279},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walk_stage","volume":"1","loop":"false","channel":"nw1","id":280},{"type":"stopsound","fadetime":"2","channel":"nw1","id":281},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.7","delay":"0.3","id":282},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":283},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":284},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“校官”","text":"或者，你也可以趁现在去巴结几位大员，让他们一会儿为你美言几句。","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"我......做不到。","id":288},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“校官”","text":"你倒很正直。","id":290,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"“校官”先生，这些人......他们真的一向如此吗？","id":292},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“校官”","text":"哈，一向如此？","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“校官”","text":"“官僚”，他曾经为了银石崖前线的后勤殚精竭虑，几日几夜没合眼，累到差点在纳斯尔纱的农业地块昏死过去。","id":295,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“校官”","text":"“酷吏”，他是个铁石心肠的恶棍，但战争期间，纳斯尔纱附近囤粮的豪商和贵族只要听见他的名字，腿就吓得发软。","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“校官”","text":"“拷问者”，我见过他以听别人哀号和惨叫为乐，可也见过他如同一条发疯的牙兽，冲入敌人的军阵......","id":297,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“校官”","text":"可现在呢？如果不是殿下否决，城里已经困难到这种地步，这些人恐怕还想着一顿丰盛的晚宴呢。","id":299,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_723_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":300},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":301},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":302},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_723_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":303},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":304},{"type":"dialog","id":305},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":306},{"type":"charslot","id":307},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":308},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.4","channel":"bse","fadetime":"1.5","id":309},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":310},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":311},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1749_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“拷问者”","text":"唉，我们的“校官”先生还是那么不合群。","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“拷问者”","text":"“官僚”，倒是你，你怎么了？你兴致也不高？","id":314},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_246","focus":"m","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"城里现在缺粮，我有责任。","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_246.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_234","focus":"m","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“监察官”","text":"嗐，粮食歉收，能怎么办？","id":318,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_234.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“监察官”","text":"（耳语）再说，我不是给你出嫁祸维多利亚人的主意了吗？那个艾玛也照你教的说了，城里人也上钩了，你现在慌什么？","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_234.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“监察官”","text":"（耳语）城里就算真饿起肚子了，那些人把领袖当成什么似的，肯定也不会冲着我们来。","id":320,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_234.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“监察官”","text":"（耳语）难道那个艾玛要反水？","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_234.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_246","focus":"m","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"（耳语）那倒不是。她自打回来就心神不宁，不过既然已经老老实实照我们说的做，我就不慌了。","id":323,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_246.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"（耳语）我现在担心的是和艾玛接头的那个商人，一点音讯都没有。放在以前，今天上午就该有信儿了。","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_246.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_234","focus":"m","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“监察官”","text":"（耳语）那就是耽搁了呗——","id":326,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_234.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1749_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“拷问者”","text":"二位偷偷聊什么呢？","id":328},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_246","focus":"m","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"那个，我们......","id":330,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_246.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_234","focus":"m","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“监察官”","text":"我们在说那个英雄库林的事呢。","id":332,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_234.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1749_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“拷问者”","text":"他？他怎么了？","id":334},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_234","focus":"m","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“监察官”","text":"他当年说的是自己在黑林里借着地形弄死了一整队维多利亚斥候，四五个人，最后剩了个孩子没忍心下手，是不是？","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_234.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“监察官”","text":"可你自己想，一队斥候怎么会带个孩子？","id":337,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_234.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1749_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“拷问者”","text":"嗯？“守灵人”解释过，那队斥候是挟持了一帮以前往来塔拉和维多利亚的商队，帮他们在黑林里带的路......","id":339},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_234","focus":"m","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“监察官”","text":"商队多半是有的，可斥候......哼，我看啊，不好说。","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_234.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":342},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":343},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bse","fadetime":"2","id":344},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":345},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":346},{"type":"charslot","id":347},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e6/Avg_bg_bg_snowconutryinside.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":348},{"type":"bg","duration":"0.1","from":"0","to":"1","block":"true","id":349},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":350},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_saferoom_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":351,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":352},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":353},{"type":"bg","duration":"1.5","from":"1","to":"0","block":"true","id":354},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":355},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"“可斥候......哼，我看啊，不好说。”","id":357},{"type":"dialog","id":358},{"type":"charslot","id":359},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_bottlecollide","volume":"0.6","id":360},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":361},{"type":"text","text":"作家讲得口渴，抓起杯子仰头，可啤酒已经喝干了。","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"我再去为您叫一杯啤酒。","id":363},{"type":"dialog","id":364},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_chairrub","volume":"1","id":365},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":366},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cloakmovement","volume":"1","id":367},{"type":"text","text":"神秘的女性起身去了吧台，作家则顺势靠在椅背上。","id":368},{"type":"text","text":"多年的习惯让他盘算着该如何将接下来的部分讲得引人入胜，可盘算着盘算着，他心里突然一紧。","id":369},{"type":"text","text":"即便这女人姑且也算是自己的难友，知道些有的没的，至少接下来这一段自己决不该像之前那样和盘托出。","id":370},{"type":"text","text":"天知道她会不会出去乱说。","id":371},{"type":"text","text":"这是故事。故事是火映在墙上的影子，而不是火焰本身。讲故事的人需要牢记这一点，不然只会被火焰焚身。","id":372},{"type":"dialog","id":373},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_glassclink","volume":"0.7","id":374},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":375},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"您的啤酒。","id":376},{"type":"dialog","id":377},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drinkswllw","id":378},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drinkswllw","loop":"false","channel":"1","delay":"1.2","id":379},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":380},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"多谢。让我想想，刚才讲到哪里了？","id":382},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#6$1","focus":"n","id":383},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"深池在庆功会上的丑态。","id":384},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":385},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"唔，是的，丑态。","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"那么，这场庆功会真正的主角马上就要登场......","id":387},{"type":"dialog","id":388},{"type":"charslot","id":389},{"type":"bg","duration":"1.5","from":"0","to":"1","block":"true","id":390},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":391},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":392},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":393},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":394},{"type":"charslot","id":395},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_bg_34_g6_noblelivingroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":396},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"0.8","block":"true","id":397},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":398},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":399},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":400},{"type":"text","text":"这场庆功会真正的主角马上就要登场。","id":401},{"type":"text","text":"但在那之前，深池的丑态仍在持续，让人无法直视。","id":402},{"type":"dialog","id":403},{"type":"bg","duration":"1.5","from":"1","to":"0","block":"true","id":404},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":405},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$sjoyasorrow_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_sjoyasorrow_loop.mp3","volume":"0","id":406,"musicid":3},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"bse1","id":407},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.5","channel":"bse1","fadetime":"4","id":408},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"3","id":409},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"2.5","keep":"true","initamount":"0.8","amount":"0","block":"true","id":410},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":411},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_246","focus":"m","id":412},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"唉，我倒是——","id":413,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_246.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"啧。","id":414,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_246.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_234","focus":"m","id":415},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“酷吏”","text":"怎么了？","id":416,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_234.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_246","focus":"m","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"我头顶是不是有什么东西爬过去了？","id":418,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_246.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_234","focus":"m","id":419},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“酷吏”","text":"哈，天气都这么冷了，纳斯尔纱居然还有虫子。你别动，我把它抓下来——","id":420,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_234.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“酷吏”","text":"等等，这......","id":421,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_234.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":422},{"type":"charslot","id":423},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"3","id":424},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bse1","fadetime":"2","id":425},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":426},{"type":"text","text":"宴会厅突然静了下来。","id":427},{"type":"text","text":"所有人都盯着“官僚”的头顶，那里停着一只甲虫。","id":428},{"type":"text","text":"纯金的甲虫。","id":429},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_234","focus":"m","id":430},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“酷吏”","text":"......唔，是你背后的陈设掉下来了。给，你自己放回去吧。","id":431,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_234.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":432},{"type":"charslot","id":433},{"type":"text","text":"“酷吏”把甲虫从“官僚”头顶取下，放在他的手里。","id":434},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_insectfly","id":435},{"type":"text","text":"“官僚”松了口气，正想把甲虫放回原位，甲虫却抖了抖嵌满钻石的翅膀，往门口飞了一段，落在了大厅中央。","id":436},{"type":"dialog","id":437},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_246","focus":"m","id":438},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":439},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","volume":"0.7","id":440},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":441},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":442},{"type":"text","text":"他往前追了两步，那甲虫仿佛引诱他似的，也往前爬了一段。","id":443},{"type":"dialog","id":444},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_higheldshosfts","volume":"1","id":445},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$2","duration":"1","id":446},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":447},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_monastery_nomal.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":448,"musicid":4},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$2","focus":"m","id":449},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"好兴致啊，“官僚”先生。","id":450},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_246","focus":"m","id":451},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"殿下？！","id":452,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_246.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"shake","random":"true","power":"5","times":"60","duration":"0.3","id":453},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"我、我只是想为您追回这只乱跑的甲虫！","id":454},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$2","focus":"m","id":455},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"当然。我又怎么会责怪你呢？","id":456},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_246","focus":"m","id":457},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"您不见怪就好......","id":458,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_246.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"对了，关于之前向您禀报的祭器的事情——","id":459,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_246.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":460},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"这种小事，无关紧要。","id":461},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"真正重要的是，我忠心的仆臣们......你们应当为这场胜利受到奖赏。","id":462},{"type":"dialog","id":463},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cloakmovement","volume":"1","id":464},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":465},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":466},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_insectfly","id":467},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":468},{"type":"text","text":"爱布拉娜从地上拾起那枚甲虫，摊平掌心，甲虫“嗡”的一声飞向门口。","id":469},{"type":"dialog","id":470},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$2","duration":"0.5","id":471},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":472},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":473},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"诸位，我们此刻置身的不是别处，正是过去的盖尔王陈列珍宝的厅堂。","id":474},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"这里的陈设曾尽数被维多利亚人夺走，而今，我们终于将其中的大多数放归原位。","id":475},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"“官僚”，刚刚那枚甲虫，正是盖尔王赐予能臣的奖励，赞扬他如同不知疲倦的甲虫，将每一粒谷物收入府库之中。","id":476},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"而你的确值得它。如果没有你，我们的军队恐怕已经因饥饿而不知溃散多少次了。","id":477},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$2","focus":"m","id":478},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"去追上它吧，它是你的了。只要它还愿意停留在你身边，你就可以执掌征收谷物的权力。","id":479},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_246","focus":"m","id":480},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“官僚”","text":"是......是！","id":481,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_246.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":482},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","volume":"0.7","id":483},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":484},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":485},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":486},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"接下来......","id":487},{"type":"dialog","id":488},{"type":"charslot","id":489},{"type":"text","text":"爱布拉娜扫视房间内的人群。","id":490},{"type":"text","text":"有的人直勾勾地盯着“官僚”的背影，想着自己会受赐什么，另一些人则控制不住地看向房间内的其他珍藏。","id":491},{"type":"text","text":"执掌刑律的宝剑，倾听申诉的云兽，记录历史的绳结，象征悲悯的水晶泪滴......","id":492},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":493},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"看来，各位都已经等不及了。","id":494},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#13$2","focus":"m","id":495},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"那么不如这样，请各位不必拘谨，将自己最想要的东西握在手中，如何？","id":496},{"type":"dialog","id":497},{"type":"charslot","id":498},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":499},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_armour","volume":"1","id":500},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_fsmetal","volume":"1","delay":"0.2","id":501},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_fsmetal","volume":"1","loop":"false","channel":"1","delay":"0.4","id":502},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_swordquake","volume":"0.7","loop":"false","channel":"2","delay":"0.7","id":503},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_metalroll","volume":"0.6","loop":"false","channel":"3","delay":"0.5","id":504},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":505},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":506},{"type":"text","text":"顷刻之间，一切珍宝都仿佛有了生命似的动了起来。","id":507},{"type":"text","text":"云兽奔跑，水晶滚落，绳结扭动，连镶满萨尔贡宝石的仪式剑，也从架上挣脱，甚至带着些滑稽，一跳一跳地朝着门外的方向而去。","id":508},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_450_necras_1#16$2","focus":"m","id":509},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱布拉娜","text":"去吧，我忠心的仆臣们。这就是我给你们的赏赐。","id":510},{"type":"dialog","id":511},{"type":"charslot","id":512},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_openftstprun","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"a","id":513},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"a","fadetime":"1.5","id":514},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":515},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crowdrun","volume":"0.8","text":"","id":516},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"2","ystrength":"25","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":517},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":518},{"type":"text","text":"不知是哪个人迈出了第一步，但第一步踏出之后，一切就再也不可遏制。","id":519},{"type":"text","text":"人群追着那些珍藏，从宴会厅里一拥而出。","id":520},{"type":"dialog","id":521},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":522},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":523},{"type":"charslot","id":524},{"type":"image","id":525}],"characters":["拉芙希妮","布莉吉","友善的居民","“拷问者”","“酷吏”","涅梅丝","“歌唱家”","“监察官”","“校官”","“官僚”","作家","神秘的女性","爱布拉娜"]}